WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:14.950
It was rude of me to do so,

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.800
but I tested your skills.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:24.270
The Dainagon of Suruga 
wishes to speak to you.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.550
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:24.580
<b><i>Tadanaga's Change of Heart</i></b>

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.470
Suruga-sama was sent to Kouzuke?

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.940
That's the story...

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:53.860
Forced exile at Kofu wasn't good 
enough for the shogun.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.850
That's what Iemitsu-sama said?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:03:00.970
The story of their animosity is well-known.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:03.870
Hey...

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.370
I'm helping you, so no yawning.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.920
But it's an awful story.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.850
Two brothers, hating each other.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.990
The destiny between them is that powerful.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.310
It's possible that what happened was also...

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.760
You see, it's something I've 
been thinking about.

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:35.270
<b>Joujinshuu</b>

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:30.350
Four years ago, Gei'in's last message

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:35.270
said that the Kurokuwa and 
Joujinshuu attacked them.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.860
The Kurokuwa are servants of the shogun.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.870
And they attacked Suruga-sama.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:42.910
Which means...

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.160
Impossible.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:49.500
They did so at the shogun's order.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.810
At least, Suruga-sama might 
make that assumption.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.920
No, most likely anyone would.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:04.300
Indeed. The fact that it's so 
obvious is what worries me.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.230
Perhaps the goal was to make 
Suruga-sama think that,

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.900
to turn his heart to evil.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:11.930
To evil?

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.670
Treason, for example.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:18.710
If he had even the slightest thoughts of it,

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:22.220
that would give the shogun 
an excuse to crush him.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:23.950
So...

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:25.590
No way.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.880
I'd like to think he wouldn't go that far.

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:32.680
But if Joujin was behind this...

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:39.430
It wouldn't be difficult for him 
to control the Kurokuwa.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:43.470
Did he and the shogun have a connection?

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.500
If we knew that, we could narrow 
down the possible moves

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.860
the Joujinshuu could make.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.500
Then, ask the shogun.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.330
It isn't that easy.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.230
If you want into Edo Castle,

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.200
I do have a way.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:15.830
Intruder. We, the Kurokuwa 
of Iga, will defeat you.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.520
Did you think to cut the 
threads we hang from?

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:24.100
My lord... My lord...

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:27.310
The Kurokuwa have returned.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.400
The ninjas?

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.810
What of them?

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.800
Have you forgotten?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:38.450
You ordered them to delay Suruga-sama.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:41.270
Suruga? Tadanaga?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:46.650
Why would I... delay Tadanaga?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:52.660
Do you have any message for Joujin-dono?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.330
Who is that?

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.160
I don't know that name.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.170
Farewell, then.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:07.380
Forget all that has happened 
tonight. And rest.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:13.630
Intruder!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.140
My lord! Are you all right?

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.730
Intruders! Everyone, get them!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.400
My lord, wake up!

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.620
It seems you wasted your time...

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:05.440
I believe it's better for both 
of us if we make no noise.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.560
Was that your doing, as well?

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.110
It's a pleasure to meet you,

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:18.490
Namenba-dono, of Iga.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.830
Houren?

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:59.370
Gorone-san said it could be seen as one...

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.940
What's a houren?

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:04.750
A carriage the emperor rides in.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.100
But it could also be a castle.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.040
I wonder if it's Portuguese.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.620
I don't know...

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.840
But it's good for bringing customers in.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.760
During the three days since it appeared, 
our sales have gone way up.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.650
But who's in it, really?

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:25.270
The Joujinshuu.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.520
Impossible. Are you saying they made it?

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:35.400
I don't know. But I feel something bad in it.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.100
Something bad?

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:40.120
Just like when they came.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.440
Then, we shouldn't just be staring at it.

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:48.890
Shouldn't we go talk to the men?

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:49.750
No.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:54.170
They're gone. They have 
been since yesterday.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.420
Gone?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.170
Gone how?

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.050
Don't ask me.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:02.150
Then, we'll do it ourselves—

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.050
Wait.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.400
I may just be imagining it.

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:07.810
Yeah...

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:12.560
And if it's a castle, we should 
wait for Namenba.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.290
But she isn't here.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.880
Let's wait.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.710
She said she'll be here before 
the cherry blossoms bloom.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.570
But...

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:24.970
This is an order from me, as leader.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.470
<b>Takasaki Castle</b>

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.470
<b>Tadanaga's Residence</b>

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.530
Well done.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.240
I am glad you have come.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.240
Yes, my lord.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.370
Relax.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:09.620
I have no title and no territory now.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.750
Have you heard why you've been called here?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:17.730
No.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:21.040
I have come here as part of my duty,

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.380
as former leader of the 
Five Treasures of Kouga.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.190
Former, eh?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.620
I am sorry for what I did to them.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.830
That is a ninja's duty.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:32.690
Indeed.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:37.040
You know the one called "Joujin," yes?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:41.400
The one who slew the Five Treasures of 
Kouga and the Five Flowers of Iga.

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:44.040
When it happened...

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:46.510
When the Five Treasures were defeated...

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.410
I was there.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.160
I am aware.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:52.700
I see.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:59.310
They defeated the Five Treasures 
and the Five Flowers

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:02.530
simply to show me their power.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:05.320
Indeed.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:08.470
To demonstrate our power to you.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:15.480
Joujin captured me, and he
pushed me to do a certain thing!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.600
Have you heard the stories?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.570
That this thing appeared near Kinokawa?

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:27.480
He calls it "Murakumo."

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.720
Going to look at it?

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.000
Don't make noise...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.690
Is it all right to leave that thing?

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:44.430
What do you think?

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.630
Right?

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:52.060
We should definitely go and investigate it.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:54.520
If we learn it has nothing to 
do with the Joujinshuu,

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.650
that's the end of it, right?

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.980
But Hibiki said not to go.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.570
We'll just go for a bit and come right back.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.790
Isn't it better for Hibiki

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:07.630
that we know what that is, 
so she needn't worry?

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:17.340
Why not offer an imperial carriage to 
Mount Kouya in my mother's memory?

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:22.180
That is what Joujin suggested, and I 
gave him much money to do it,

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.120
thinking it would help my mother.

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.070
This was six years ago.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.390
To be honest, I'd almost forgotten.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.090
But...

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.180
Now, you find this?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.380
Does that look like an imperial 
carriage to you?!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.190
It's a castle!

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:42.710
And they made such a thing during

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.690
my father's mourning period!

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.230
Why would he make such a thing?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.450
I don't know...

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:51.300
I don't know.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.860
A castle was constructed without 
the Shogunate's knowledge,

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:58.710
and I paid for it.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.300
If people learn this, what am I to say then?!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:06.090
Joujin slew the Five Treasures 
and Five Flowers

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.530
just to raise money from you 
for an imperial carriage?

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:11.980
For that, alone?

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:15.100
What are you trying to say?

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.420
That's right...

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:27.570
Considering you to be an 
enemy would be suicide.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:30.860
I would not use my techniques on my lord.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:36.620
I knew it. I can't hide it from you.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:42.920
Only you and I are here.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:47.380
Hachirou, tell no one what I am about to say.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.820
Understood?

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:50.750
As you wish.

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.970
<i>Only you two?</i>

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:15.410
<i>That lord's a liar.</i>

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:19.580
It's true... It's true that Joujin

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.300
encouraged me to rebel against my brother.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:28.890
He promised that he would 
keep my mother alive...

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.030
The forest.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:37.180
Yes, unless the forest is moved, 
failure is impossible.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.030
He deceived me!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.690
True, my mother's health improved then.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.940
But less than six months later...

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:52.320
And... the forest!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.470
The forest?

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.390
The forest moved!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.210
Two years ago, I went to inspect my territory

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:13.340
and was resting at Sengen Shrine.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:21.350
I was tired from my travels, 
and in a bit of a dreamy haze.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.870
The forest around the shrine...

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:44.200
It moved?

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:45.660
Indeed.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:48.050
It came right for me!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.140
I-Impossible...

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.730
The forest can't move!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.500
My lord!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.600
Monkeys! They're monkeys!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.360
What? Monkeys?

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.620
My lord, this way.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:05.280
Curse you, monkeys...

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.060
You monkeys think that you, beasts, can...

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.150
can mock me?!

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.090
My lord...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.150
Kill them! Fire your arrows!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:17.290
W-Wait, my lord.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:21.160
These monkeys are holy beasts, 
messengers of the gods!

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:22.830
I don't care...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:24.500
It must not move.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.990
The forest must not move!

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:28.100
M-My lord!

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:39.650
Hachirou, laugh at me, please.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:44.310
Joujin told me that, unless the forest 
moved, it wouldn't happen.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.950
And... And it moved!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.170
What else could this be 
but the punishment of heaven?!

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:54.320
Joujin... He's a demon.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.570
I was a fool...

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.770
I can never be such a fool again!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:05.360
Hachirou, will you destroy 
that castle, Murakumo?

00:19:05.360 --> 00:19:09.580
Destroy the five Joujinshuu 
and burn it to the ground!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.890
Not just for me!

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:15.150
For the Tokugawa! For the safety of Japan!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.340
I refuse.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.060
Wh-What?

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:22.640
I'm sorry, but don't try to take 
advantage of us, further.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.420
What? What?

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.850
What did you say?!

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:28.100
Have you forgotten?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.430
In the nineteenth year of Keichou,

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:33.400
eighteen of the best Iga and Kouga ninjas

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:38.110
died for nothing more than to determine 
the Tokugawa clan's next heir.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:41.110
That isn't all.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.820
The Five Treasures and Five Flowers

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:49.320
died for you, a fool who thought of treason.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:53.630
And young ninjas were almost killed, as well.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:20:00.630
We ninjas refuse to sacrifice ourselves 
for the likes of the Tokugawa!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.830
"The likes of the Tokugawa"?

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.910
Scum, how dare you say that?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.390
I've told you my deepest thoughts!

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:11.770
But you would refuse me?!

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.770
You won't return alive!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.460
Connect with my eyes!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.740
<i>Saizou?</i>

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.550
Surprised, Hachirou?

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:11.900
My techniques have also improved...

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.250
I call this technique "Hundred Eyes."

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.130
Fool! He's over there!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.560
Will you still fight?

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:30.110
If so, you will only suffer for nothing.

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:39.370
My lord, if we let him go,

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:42.310
the Shogunate will learn of your feelings.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.610
No...

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:47.030
That cannot happen.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.030
Kill him...

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.140
Kill him.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:53.920
Kill him!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:27.090
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:28.730
The evil castle is called Murakumo,

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:30.980
and it stands, tall and dark, in the forest.

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:33.570
Women search out its mysteries,

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:36.970
and men seek their master.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:38.100
<b><i>The Advent of Joujin</i></b>

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.580
And now, everything begins to move.
